set Title "ILI通用资源保护逻辑"
set Instruction "V1.1 | 只可在V8版本使用 | 只要有任意可被逻辑控制的单位，此逻辑就可锁定核心生效 | 支持S/E星工厂、兵厂(S仅支持t2及以上)、布热&氰合成机 | 链接到分离解离机无效，爆厂只有满停，不支持空装卸器控制"
set Author "[blue]Ili[#8abcd1]ary[#654321]艾铭[red]"
print "ILI通用资源保护逻辑"
print "V1.1"
print "仅可在V8及以上版本使用"
print "逻辑锁定到需要资源保护的建筑，链接到的建筑物品容量大于等于2000被视为核心（容器300、仓库1000不算）。"
print "如果没有链接核心。只要有任意可被逻辑控制的单位，此逻辑就可锁定核心生效"
print "支持S/E星工厂、兵厂(S仅支持t2及以上E仅支持t4以下)、布热&氰合成机、热量反应堆、矿渣离心机，不支持空装卸器控制。"
print "链接到大硅厂默认检测煤沙铅，链接分离解离无效，爆厂只有满停。S星t1兵厂只在缺硅时停用，其它兵厂全检测。"
set limit.min 1000
print "资源保护最低阈值（缺停）"
set limit.core% 0.95
print "产物最大核心占比（满停）"
set flash.time 300000
print "核心刷新时间，单位为ms，用于防止逻辑失效。"
printflush message1
jump 19 lessThan timer @time
jump 36 notEqual core null
set i.b 0
getlink core i.b
sensor iscore core @itemCapacity
jump 34 greaterThanEq iscore 2000
op add i.b i.b 1
jump 20 lessThan i.b @links
set core null
set i.unit 0
lookup unit uty i.unit
ubind uty
ulocate building core 0 @copper 0 0 0 core
op add i.unit i.unit 1
jump 19 greaterThanEq i.unit @unitCount
wait 1
jump 27 strictEqual core null
ucontrol unbind 0 0 0 0 0
op add timer @time flash.time
set graphite-press 1
set multi-press 1
set silicon-smelter 1
set silicon-crucible 1
set kiln 1
set plastanium-compressor 1
set phase-weaver 1
set surge-smelter 1
set cryofluid-mixer 1
set pyratite-mixer 1
set blast-mixer 1
set cultivator 1
set silicon-arc-furnace 1
set oxidation-chamber 1
set phase-heater 1
set carbide-crucible 1
set surge-crucible 1
set phase-synthesizer 1
set cyanogen-synthesizer 1
set additive-reconstructor 1
set multiplicative-reconstructor 1
set exponential-reconstructor 1
set tetrative-reconstructor 1
set tank-fabricator 1
set ship-fabricator 1
set mech-fabricator 1
set tank-refabricator 1
set ship-refabricator 1
set mech-refabricator 1
set prime-refabricator 1
set heat-reactor 1
set slag-centrifuge 1
set ground-factory 1
set air-factory 1
set naval-factory 1
sensor c.core core @itemCapacity
op mul limit.core c.core limit.core%
sensor copper core @copper
jump 76 greaterThan copper limit.min
set surge-smelter 0
sensor lead core @lead
jump 82 greaterThan lead limit.min
set pyratite-mixer 0
set silicon-crucible 0
set kiln 0
set surge-smelter 0
sensor metaglass core @metaglass
jump 85 greaterThan metaglass limit.min
set multiplicative-reconstructor 0
jump 87 lessThan metaglass limit.core
set kiln 0
sensor graphite core @graphite
jump 93 greaterThan graphite limit.min
set silicon-arc-furnace 0
set cyanogen-synthesizer 0
set additive-reconstructor 0
set ship-fabricator 0
jump 96 lessThan graphite limit.core
set graphite-press 0
set multi-press 0
sensor sand core @sand
jump 106 greaterThan sand limit.min
set silicon-arc-furnace 0
set silicon-smelter 0
set silicon-crucible 0
set kiln 0
set phase-weaver 0
set pyratite-mixer 0
set phase-synthesizer 0
set slag-centrifuge 0
sensor coal core @coal
jump 113 greaterThan coal limit.min
set graphite-press 0
set multi-press 0
set silicon-smelter 0
set surge-crucible 0
set pyratite-mixer 0
sensor titanium core @titanium
jump 120 greaterThan titanium limit.min
set surge-smelter 0
set plastanium-compressor 0
set cryofluid-mixer 0
set multiplicative-reconstructor 0
set exponential-reconstructor 0
sensor thorium core @thorium
jump 126 greaterThan thorium limit.min
set phase-weaver 0
set phase-synthesizer 0
set prime-refabricator 0
set heat-reactor 0
sensor silicon core @silicon
jump 144 greaterThan silicon limit.min
set surge-smelter 0
set surge-crucible 0
set additive-reconstructor 0
set multiplicative-reconstructor 0
set exponential-reconstructor 0
set tetrative-reconstructor 0
set tank-fabricator 0
set ship-fabricator 0
set mech-fabricator 0
set tank-refabricator 0
set ship-refabricator 0
set mech-refabricator 0
set prime-refabricator 0
set ground-factory 0
set air-factory 0
set naval-factory 0
jump 148 lessThan silicon limit.core
set silicon-smelter 0
set silicon-crucible 0
set silicon-arc-furnace 0
sensor plastanium core @plastanium
jump 152 greaterThan plastanium limit.min
set exponential-reconstructor 0
set tetrative-reconstructor 0
jump 154 lessThan plastanium limit.core
set plastanium-compressor 0
sensor phase-fabric core @phase-fabric
jump 158 greaterThan phase-fabric limit.min
set phase-heater 0
set tetrative-reconstructor 0
jump 161 lessThan phase-fabric limit.core
set phase-weaver 0
set phase-synthesizer 0
sensor surge-alloy core @surge-alloy
jump 164 greaterThan surge-alloy limit.min
set tetrative-reconstructor 0
jump 167 lessThan surge-alloy limit.core
set surge-smelter 0
set surge-crucible 0
sensor spore-pod core @spore-pod
jump 170 lessThan spore-pod limit.core
set cultivator 0
sensor blast-compound core @blast-compound
jump 173 lessThan blast-compound limit.core
set blast-mixer 0
sensor pyratite core @pyratite
jump 176 lessThan pyratite limit.core
set pyratite-mixer 0
sensor beryllium core @beryllium
jump 181 greaterThan beryllium limit.min
set oxidation-chamber 0
set tank-fabricator 0
set mech-fabricator 0
sensor tungsten core @tungsten
jump 187 greaterThan tungsten limit.min
set carbide-crucible 0
set tank-refabricator 0
set ship-refabricator 0
set mech-refabricator 0
sensor oxide core @oxide
jump 190 lessThan oxide limit.core
set oxidation-chamber 0
sensor carbide core @carbide
jump 193 lessThan carbide limit.core
set carbide-crucible 0
set i.b 0
getlink b i.b
sensor bty b @type
sensor n.b bty @name
read e @this n.b
jump 201 strictEqual e null
control enabled b e 0 0 0
jump 206 always 0 false
sensor cfg b @config
sensor c.cfg core cfg
jump 206 strictEqual cfg null
op greaterThan e c.cfg limit.min
control enabled b e 0 0 0
op add i.b i.b 1
jump 194 lessThan i.b @links
jump 17 always 0 "[blue]Ili[#8abcd1]ary[#654321]艾铭[red]"
